man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Accompanied by a haunting soundtrack from Priscilla Snow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No generative artificial intelligence (AI) was used in the creation of this game or promotional materials. Draknek &amp; Friends believes in the value of real human labour and inspiration in all of our endeavours.</p>","developers":["Draknek and Friends"],"dlc":[4043690],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/5a335989e8937d2dfe6f805419061f12229cb3e2/header.jpg?t=1770741164","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Draknek Limited<br />\r\n<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support or Metal 3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352310/1020739509/451419561c6ec4d954ddd745f507dcf15ca8830d/1761056908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761660048","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352310/1020739509/451419561c6ec4d954ddd745f507dcf15ca8830d/1761056908/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761660048","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352310/1020739509/451419561c6ec4d954ddd745f507dcf15ca8830d/1761056908/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761660048","id":257220524,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220524/5e3fd57c25441ced68c5e4edddb0c888cf5d972c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761660048"}],"name":"Spooky Express","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name