ers are dying to ride the Spooky Express! Don\u2019t let them miss their stops: they may be monsters, but they still have places to be and people to eat \u2013 er, we mean meet!","steam_appid":3352310,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"http://www.draknek.org/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":"http://spooky.express/"}